# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 8 (a blueprint value is built at the applying block's next positions), ch. 9 (a forwarding host's place for the child's place p is 0/[p]/0) and ruling TC: the blueprint builds the child's places 0 and 1, and the child's own label is its place 2. Never run: prismc refuses the program.
test a_blueprint_value_under_a_host

tick 0
  added:
    0/[0]/0: Ui.Label(text="left")
    0/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="right")
    0/[2]/0: Ui.Label(text="end")
